#!/usr/bin/env python
"""
Standalone snippet-based marginal log-likelihood-ratio (marginal_loglr)
followup and coincidence tool.

Takes primary candidate triggers from pycbc_inspiral_fir (or merged trigger
HDF5 files), applies full signal-consistency weighting (newsnr_sgveto_autochisq,
rchisq, hollow veto, CAT2 vetoes) on both primary and secondary detectors,
reconstructs complex SNR snippets around the primary peak and across the
zero-lag sky window and decimated background time-slide windows in the
secondary detector(s) using matchedfilter.TimeDomainFilterBank, combines
SingleTemplate / DistMarg coherent extrinsic marginalization with
ExpFitStatistic template-calibrated noise models, and writes a standard PyCBC
coincidence HDF5 output file.
"""

